          },
          "text": "Why Cross-Platform Mobile App Development Matters in 2024"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 4,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Cross-platform mobile app development has become increasingly important in 2024 as businesses aim to reach wider audiences across iOS, Android and web platforms. Developing separate native apps for each platform is costly and time-consuming."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 6,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 6,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Cross-platform frameworks like Ionic allow companies to build apps that run on multiple platforms from a single codebase. This greatly reduces development time and cost while enabling feature parity and consistent user experiences across devices."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 8,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 8,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Key benefits of cross-platform mobile app development in 2024 include:"
        }
