                  },
                  "text": "Live app updates, auth and CI/CD with Capgo or Appflow"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 50,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 50,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "By leveraging web standards, Ionic enables developers to use their existing skills to build high-quality apps for any platform. A single codebase dramatically reduces development time and maintenance costs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 52,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "In 2024, Ionic continues to push the envelope of what's possible with web technologies. Ionic 7 introduces powerful design tools, improved performance, and even tighter integrations with native SDKs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 54,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 54,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Getting Started"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 56,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 56,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "In summary, cross-platform is increasingly becoming the default for app development as more companies realize the business benefits in 2024. Frameworks like Ionic enable a web-first approach, empowering developers to build amazing apps for billions of users in record time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 58,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 58,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "From startups to large enterprises, teams are using Ionic to power vital apps for customers, partners and employees across industries. If you're considering a new mobile project in 2024, a cross-platform approach with Ionic is well worth exploring."
        }
      ]
    },
